# Rule: trust_score_low_warning
# Category: Trust Violation
# Severity: medium
# Attack Class: trust_degradation
#
# Early-warning: fires when trust score drops below 0.5 but is still >= 0.3.
# Generates a medium-severity alert, allowing SOC teams to investigate before
# the agent crosses the critical threshold.

trust_score(event.agent_id, "agent") < 0.5
AND trust_score(event.agent_id, "agent") >= 0.3
